aining  along with weightlifting yoga and  strength training benedict cumberbatch's  workout routine also includes plenty of  cardiovascular exercise cumberbatch is a  longtime fan of cardio activities like  running which he has been doing for  years to keep fit however he needed to  increase the intensity of his cardio  while training for the mcu so he decided  to incorporate interval sprints  according to superhero jacks his typical  20-minute interval sprint exercise would  be split into two sessions for the first  he would walk for two minutes then  sprint for one then halfway through he  would cut down his walk time to one  minute and run one then walk one for the  remaining session cumberbatch also went  through months of physical training to  learn how to fight and move properly on  the set of doctor strange most of this  combat and martial arts training took  place alongside his stunt double george  kirby and his co-star mass mickelson  with cumberbatch taking his workout  routine up a few notches since 2016  there's little doubt the actors been  putting in a few days of high intensity  cardio each week to get ripped for the  sequel  benedict cumberbatch eats pretty  healthily all year while filming the bbc  detective drama sherlock cumberbatch  kept himself in very good shape by  eating very sensibly that's his co-star  rupert graves told the daily mail the  actor continued to say he only eats  bananas hummus vegetables and nuts and  then he has a special lunch brought in  however cumberbatch's diet had to change  when he started training for the 2016  superhero film with all the exercise he  was doing he had to increase his calorie  intake given how much cumberbatch has  stepped up his physical training for  doctor strange in the multiverse of  madness it only makes sense that he has  also upped his calorie intake again as  reported by men's health the average  recommended calorie intake for a man  ranges from about 1 800 and 2  300 per day if cumberbatch 